  <clipboard-copy role="menuitem" value="@aditya-yadav-27 from your question, I&#39;m guessing you are under the assumption there is only _one_ time for all of Brazil, but that is incorrect. There are _FOUR_ unique timezones in Brazil. You can see the four different time zones and their current times visualized here: [https://www.timeanddate.com/time/zone/brazil](https://www.timeanddate.com/time/zone/brazil)" data-view-component="true" class="dropdown-item btn-link">
      
