      <p dir="auto">@aditya-yadav-27 from your question, I'm guessing you are under the assumption there is only <em>one</em> time for all of Brazil, but that is incorrect. There are <em>FOUR</em> unique timezones in Brazil. You can see the four different time zones and their current times visualized here: <a href="https://www.timeanddate.com/time/zone/brazil" rel="nofollow">https://www.timeanddate.com/time/zone/brazil</a></p>
    </div>
  </task-lists>
  
</div>


