  <clipboard-copy role="menuitem" value="hi there 

i just like to say i love your bot so keep up the great work 

for Australian

Australia uses three main time zones: 
Australian Western Standard Time (AWST; UTC+08:00), 
Australian Central Standard Time (ACST; UTC+09:30), 
Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST; UTC+10:00).

you can also confirm here https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_in_Australia#:~:text=Australia%20uses%20three%20main%20time,UTC%2B10%3A00)." data-view-component="true" class="dropdown-item btn-link">
      
              Copy Markdown

