      <p dir="auto">hi there</p>
<p dir="auto">i just like to say i love your bot so keep up the great work</p>
<p dir="auto">for Australian</p>
<p dir="auto">Australia uses three main time zones:<br>
Australian Western Standard Time (AWST; UTC+08:00),<br>
Australian Central Standard Time (ACST; UTC+09:30),<br>
Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST; UTC+10:00).</p>
<p dir="auto">you can also confirm here <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_in_Australia#:~:text=Australia%20uses%20three%20main%20time,UTC%2B10%3A00" rel="nofollow">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_in_Australia#:~:text=Australia%20uses%20three%20main%20time,UTC%2B10%3A00</a>).</p>
    </div>
  </task-lists>
  
</div>


