</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Hey, would be cool to access your API like some user-friendly list, for everyone to be able to use it in most cases!</p>
<p dir="auto">mapped_zones = {<br>
'PST/PDT': 'America/Los_Angeles',<br>
'CT(US&amp;Canada)': 'US/Central',<br>
'ET(US&amp;Canada)': 'US/Eastern',<br>
'Colombia': 'America/Bogota',<br>
}<br>
mapped_zones.get(your_timezone)...</p>
    </div>
  </task-lists>
  
